  "job_B18.5.2_20260920_210354": {
    "chunk_text": "Haec sunt genealogiae regum Occidentalium Saxonum. Eadweard & Eadmund & \u00c6\u00f0elred \u00e6\u00f0elingas syndon, Eadgares suna cyninges. Eadgar Eadmunding, Eadmund Eadwerding, Eadweard \u00c6lfreding, \u00c6lfred A\u00feolfing, A\u00feulf Ecgbyrhting, Ingeld w\u00e6s Ines bro\u00f0or Westseaxna cyninges, & he heold rice vii & xxx wintra, & he getimbrade \u00fe\u00e6t Cenred w\u00e6s Ceolwalding, Ceolwald Cu\u00f0ing, Cu\u00fea Cu\u00f0wining, Cu\u00f0wine Ceawlining, Ceawlin Se Scef w\u00e6s Noes sunu, & he w\u00e6s innan \u00fe\u00e6re earce geboren. Noe w\u00e6s Lameches sunu, Lameh Ma\u00feusalemys, Ma\u00f0usalem w\u00e6s Enoches, Enoh, Lared, Malalehel, Heingils, Wealhstod, Coengils, Beorhtwald, Cealdhun, Luca, Wiccea, Bosa, Sti\u00f0heard, Herefyr\u00f0,.",
